| Build — assemble, compile and link HostFSFiler with the DDE.
| Produces <Obey$Dir>.HostFSFiler,ffa: one module that runs from ROM as
| well as from the RMA.  Obey halts at the first failing command, so any
| error below is the one to read.  The o directory must exist already.
|
| Built as HostFS is (../dde/Build): no cmhg and no C:o.stubs, which both
| write into the module image at initialisation.  o.relocs must hold only
| PC-relative relocations.
Set HFiler$Dir <Obey$Dir>
Dir <Obey$Dir>
objasm -o o.head s.head
cc -c -zps1 -ffah -o o.hostfsfiler c.hostfsfiler
link -rmf -o HostFSFiler,ffa o.head o.hostfsfiler
decaof -r o.head o.hostfsfiler { > o.relocs }
Echo Built <HFiler$Dir>.HostFSFiler,ffa
